\lispPackageChapter{livermore/stock-ticker-descriptions}

The \texttt{livermore/stock-ticker-descriptions} package is a table of
ticker symbols and long names.  The lists
\texttt{*dow-jones-indices*}, \texttt{*nyse-indices*},
\texttt{*nasdaq-indices*}, \texttt{*standard-and-poors-indices*},
\texttt{*other-us-indices*}, \texttt{*us-treasury-indices*},
\texttt{*us-commodities-indices*}, \texttt{*misc-stocks*}, and
\texttt{*{\textasciicircum}dji-components*} are alists of \texttt{(ticker description)}.
\texttt{*ticker-descriptions*} is a hash table of the same data.

\lispGenericSubsection{stock-description}

The long name of a ticker, or \texttt{nil} if it is unknown.  Methods exist
for strings and symbols; \texttt{livermore/stocks} adds a method on
\texttt{table}.
